Description: unofficial two-way Proton Drive sync client for GNOME
 Halyard keeps paired local and Proton Drive folders in sync, preserves both
 copies when changes conflict, and provides a GTK interface for folders,
 photos and activity. The daemon runs on the session bus as the logged-in
 user and keeps credentials in the user's keyring.
 .
 This third-party application is not affiliated with or supported by Proton.
